From: YapLabs <folia@yaplabs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP spawn search must not sync-load the cut

100-bot carve emptied the hole and requestPartition(0) ran. A bot death
then PlayerSpawnFinder.getLevelRespawnPos → syncLoadNonFull into the
ticket wall. The region thread parked in managedBlock (never FULL) and
watchdog-stalled before "into 2 shards". Skip cut keys; use loaded
chunks only. Not force-unload, not delete load. Post-applyAllPatches.
---

--- a/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
+++ b/folia-server/src/minecraft/java/net/minecraft/server/level/PlayerSpawnFinder.java
@@ -150,8 +150,22 @@
     }
 
     public static @Nullable BlockPos getLevelRespawnPos(final ServerLevel level, final int x, final int z) { // Folia - public
+        final int chunkX = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(x);
+        final int chunkZ = SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(z);
+        // Packed-spawn cut: syncLoadNonFull into the empty buffer parks the region thread
+        // forever (ticket wall never completes). Death during carve then watchdog-stalls
+        // before forcePartition can log into-shards.
+        if (io.papermc.paper.threadedregions.YapRegionizerGap.blocksAddChunk(level, chunkX, chunkZ)) {
+            return null;
+        }
         boolean caveWorld = level.dimensionType().hasCeiling();
-        net.minecraft.world.level.chunk.ChunkAccess chunk = level.moonrise$getChunkTaskScheduler().syncLoadNonFull(SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(x), SectionPos.blockToSectionCoord(z), net.minecraft.world.level.chunk.status.ChunkStatus.SPAWN); // Folia - region threading
+        net.minecraft.world.level.chunk.ChunkAccess chunk = level.getChunkIfLoaded(chunkX, chunkZ);
+        if (chunk == null) {
+            chunk = level.moonrise$getChunkTaskScheduler().syncLoadNonFull(chunkX, chunkZ, net.minecraft.world.level.chunk.status.ChunkStatus.SPAWN); // Folia - region threading
+        }
+        if (chunk == null) {
+            return null;
+        }
         int topY = caveWorld ? level.getChunkSource().getGenerator().getSpawnHeight(level) : chunk.getHeight(Heightmap.Types.MOTION_BLOCKING, x & 15, z & 15);
         if (topY < level.getMinY()) {
             return null;
